  "starterCode": "-- Write your SQL query here\n",
  "solution": "### \ud83d\udca1 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### \u26a1 Implementation\n```sql\nWITH ranked AS (\n  SELECT caller_id, receiver_id, call_time,\n         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY caller_id, receiver_id ORDER BY call_time) AS rn_first,\n         ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY caller_id, receiver_id ORDER BY call_time DESC) AS rn_last\n  FROM calls\n)\nSELECT caller_id, receiver_id,\n       MAX(CASE WHEN rn_first = 1 THEN call_time END) AS first_call,\n       MAX(CASE WHEN rn_last = 1 THEN call_time END) AS last_call\nFROM ranked\nGROUP BY caller_id, receiver_id\nORDER BY caller_id, receiver_id;\n```\n\n### \u23f1\ufe0f Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
